        "y0": 0.23119556611243067,
        "x1": 0.6966612127896629,
        "y1": 0.3269992082343625
      },
      "text": "On Monday 18th October; approximately 500 members of our Chisholm community gathered to acknowledge some of the wonderful team and individual sporting performances for 2010.  Special guests Ms Shae Bolton West Coast Fever Netball) and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24920758817636657,
        "y0": 0.32897862232779096,
        "x1": 0.6905010252167639,
        "y1": 0.4026128266033254
      },
      "text": "Mr Trent Mitton (Kookaburras medalist at the recent Delhi Commonwealth Games) shared the night with our future sporting stars. Both were able to offer some advice and inspiration for all who attended. gold",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7027880912428563,
        "y0": 0.13991427025149383,
        "x1": 0.9584382168980496,
        "y1": 0.3640761930415862
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "caption",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7224219971854221,
        "y0": 0.3681710213776722,
        "x1": 0.9419486816014573,
        "y1": 0.39429928741092635
      },
      "text": "Trent with Lara Ameduri and Danika Vidakovich",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3617710156447928,
        "y0": 0.40182106096595405,
        "x1": 0.8361054587580118,
        "y1": 0.4220110847189232
      },
      "text": "Congratulations to all our award winners and in particular",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24640750291595792,
        "y0": 0.42121931908155186,
        "x1": 0.9514689714868467,
        "y1": 0.45961995249406173
      },
      "text": "Justin Skowron who was awarded the  Peter Tonkin? award for the most outstanding Year 12 sports person.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5012152616131417,
        "y0": 0.46120348376880443,
        "x1": 0.6949811616334177,
        "y1": 0.47783056215360253
      },
      "text": "Well done to all of you.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4474536246132963,
        "y0": 0.47941409342834523,
        "x1": 0.7498628327374265,
        "y1": 0.4968329374505146
      },
      "text": "Mr Andrew Glover, Head of Sport",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
